OL,3,AKrakow shooting suspect has died in
OL,4,Ahospital, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gunman suspected of killing six
OL,7,Fpeople in Krakow has died in hospital,
OL,8,FPolish police say.
OL,10,FThe 24-year-old, who officials said was
OL,11,Fapparently inspired by "far-right
OL,12,Fideologies", was injured after opening
OL,13,Ffire in central Krakow, the second
OL,14,Flargest city in Poland, on Saturday.
OL,16,FArmed officers raced to the scene and
OL,17,Fengaged in a gunfight with the suspect,
OL,18,Fwho was shot within three minutes of
OL,19,Fthe attack beginning, preventing a
OL,20,Ffurther massacre, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
